This directory contains the scripts to reproduce the examples shown in the paper by Jack Carter and David Rossell about Positive-definiteness in separable priors.

- truncation_effect_prior.Rmd. Example showing the effect of the positive-definiteness truncation on the prior distribution of a sparse random symmetric matrix.

- simulation_posteriorinference.Rmd. Simulation study showing the effects on posterior inference of using several settings for the prior distribution of a sparse random symmetric matrix.

